insert into public.terms (slug, term_en, term_as, meaning_en, meaning_as) values ($t$maidam$t$, $t$Maidam$t$, $t$মৈদাম$t$, $t$A burial mound of the Ahom royals and nobles. The Charaideo Maidams are the best known.$t$, $t$আহোম ৰজা আৰু বিষয়াসকলৰ সমাধিস্থল। চৰাইদেউৰ মৈদামসমূহ আটাইতকৈ জনাজাত।$t$) on conflict (slug) do nothing;
